'''Roundy''' is a type of Round Worm added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'' DLC.

Like the Round Worm, a Roundy will burrow into the ground and appear somewhere else. When it surfaces, it releases a small rock wave around it and fires an {{i|Ipecac}} shot towards Isaac.

The Roundy's rock wave and explosive projectile can kill other monsters including each other.
